  "2026-10-22T12:08:55.456Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: full3058-item all-status corpus plus current open/in-progress lists and nightly timeout shard keyword search find no exact open allocation owner. Full live closed pm-qrirz8 and pm-ul9rye confirm completed prior allocation fixes; pm-bj7rq0 remains open for broader product startup performance. Job119798730778 and119798730969 annotations explicitly report maximum execution time20m0s; retain canceled evidence rather than recast it as green. GitHub official workflow syntax and contexts documentation supports needs.result admission and always aggregate execution: https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/workflow-syntax and https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/contexts ."
  "2026-10-22T12:11:51.082Z","harness:codex","Allocation retains the20-minute bound and uses14 complete native partitions: Linux22 and25 two each, Linux24 coverage four, macOS24 two, Windows24 four. Global coverage runs only after every native partition succeeds, using all four blobs and unchanged exact100% thresholds. Reliability derives the aggregate family too, so missing aggregate evidence remains pending. Existing recurrence families now require all four Windows partitions. No assertion, per-test deadline, retry, coverage denominator or original failure is weakened."
