  "2026-10-22T12:15:20.566Z","harness:codex","Final corrected unchanged-main negative run now reports exactly5 intended failures and53 passing controls after aligning the copied health-test placement. All58 assertions collected successfully, with no syntax or directory-layout failure. Current positive acceptance remains67/67. The partition proof covers852 identities without omissions or duplicates. Candidate6899ce03d is executing the complete revised native workflow in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/39776721982 ."
  "2026-10-22T12:20:07.648Z","harness:codex","Static quality correctly refused the new recurs_from lineage because pm-gxq0dt and completed predecessor pm-qrirz8 lacked explicit recurrence-family membership. Add a precise bounded-complete-nightly-execution family with both canonical IDs, the unchanged-main executable negative controls, all native partition checks and strict aggregate. Preserve broad platform families, budgets and original failures. This is the captured static finding, not a product assertion failure or an exemption."
  "2026-10-22T12:36:39.817Z","harness:codex","Initial PR1548 review census: CodeRabbit full-review request received an explicit20m36s hourly chat limit; Sourcery review budget unavailable for1d16h, while its generated guide is available and assessed separately; Greptile trial ended. No purchase or paid runner is introduced. A necessary post-push full-review trigger will run after the CodeRabbit cooldown. Current CodSpeed headline51.15% improvement carries explicit different-runner and syscall warnings, so it is not treated as proven performance improvement or as evidence clearing the separate qualified local startup refusal."
  "2026-10-22T12:46:46.861Z","harness:codex","Hosted bounded allocation acceptance at6899ce03d in Nightly39776721982: all14 native partitions succeed, longest12m32s under unchanged20-minute bounds. The independent global aggregate succeeds with exact100/100/100/100 and zero uncovered counts after all native admission. The sole failed job is old-head quality, whose missing recurrence-lineage registration is fixed in e9c9f76 and whose later prose gap was resolved by recording the real relationship to completed prior allocation owner. Local evidence/registry17 checks, graph9 assertions, record integrity and bounded mutation all pass; the qualified local CLI-floor refusal remains separately recorded without a bypass. A complete revised-head nightly is still required before this item closes."
  "2026-10-22T12:56:40.511Z","harness:codex","Full maintained packed-consumer smoke now passes on the candidate with npm/npx and Bun/bunx across9 package workflows: node scripts/smoke-npx-from-pack.mjs, version2026.10.22. Test subprocess observability was explicitly disabled; real production acceptance remains a separate opt-in probe. Three SDK/workspace items are now closed with immutable structured evidence and released ownership; only this still-active full-nightly/review validation item remains in progress. Latest npm pm-changelog2026.10.21 generated and verified the three actual change entries through its configured package-owned flow."
  "2026-10-22T13:15:43.320Z","harness:codex","Reviewed-source production acceptance at13:12UTC: four real opt-in dogfood probes get/list/stats/telemetry each arrive in PostgreSQL with exactly one start and one finish, zero unmatched pairs and maximum observed delivery delay783.450ms. The physical local event spool is0bytes; RabbitMQ has0ready/0unacked and1consumer. Sentry exposes four fresh pm.command spans for those same operations, and its required telemetry gate passes critical0/high0. Successful command tracing and read sampling were explicitly enabled only for these probes; this does not claim unsampled historical actions or replace the separate qualified CLI-floor admission result. No telemetry privacy or production settings were changed."
  "2026-10-22T13:29:38.968Z","harness:codex","PR217eece7c exact-head CI completes with all required checks successful except native Windows history-index-snapshot concurrency admission and its aggregate. Job119844157232 fails the unchanged1500ms guard reader blocked authoritative append, with483 other cases passing and4 skipped. The history/index sources and this test are byte-identical to main; this is not evidence that the earlier completed reader fix is undone or that package/workspace changes caused it. One unchanged failed-jobs retry is running in CI39784395996. Keep the original failure and deadline intact; do not relax the assertion or repeatedly rerun it. Complete native nightly validation remains independent."
  "2026-10-22T13:37:58.598Z","harness:codex","Additional provider census from the GitHub checks API: Cubic is neutral because its monthly review allowance is exhausted,40405 of40000 lines, resuming November1. Source217 full CodeRabbit review was requested once and explicitly rate-limited until the next included review around13:38UTC; each of the five prior inline findings has a concrete reply and resolved thread, with CodeRabbit confirmations. Sourcery quota and Greptile trial unavailability remain limitations, not approvals. No paid provider, runner, quota override or review-pattern relaxation is used."
  "2026-10-22T13:43:24.340Z","harness:codex","The one unchanged failed-jobs retry of CI39784395996 is successful at attempt2 on217eece7c. The initial suspended-reader append-guard failure remains retained, with no source,1500ms bound or retry-policy change. This is successful same-head retry evidence, not proof of its cause or a repair to historical reader contention. The separately reproduced Windows file-ancestor defect has an explicit SDK directory check and remains active under its review leaf."
  "2026-10-22T14:22:18.686Z","harness:codex","Read-only watcher liveness audit: GitHub jobs API still reports Packed first run Windows24 job119861968189 in_progress with completed_at null, but every step is completed successfully through14:11:27UTC. Chrome confirms the same exact68499c070 job succeeded in17m36s, including15m09s full npm/npx/Bun/bunx acceptance. The overall old CI run remains failed on the known stale SDK vocabulary receipt. Stop only the stale read-only watcher, preserve all run outcomes, and replace this superseded source head with the generated receipt correction. This is an API-state inconsistency, not missing packed consumer execution."
  "2026-10-22T14:45:51.181Z","harness:codex","Current-source acceptance: Nightly Validation39795091164 at744a4c95ae579326cf3c7fde2b2dd749d32a86f5 completes successfully. All14 native partitions and quality satisfy the unchanged20-minute limits, and the admitted aggregate reports851 passed files plus1 existing skip,11035 passed tests plus3 existing skips, and exact100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts. Full logs retain every original failure and the strict refusal controls. This proves the bounded complete allocator; it does not erase historical Release Reliability failures or qualified local CLI startup misses, which remain separately tracked. Required PR acceptance and the final metadata review still must complete before merge."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T12:13:53.661Z","harness:codex","When introducing coverage aggregation, register the new pipeline in the executable gate inventory and derive its expected reliability family from each original workflow. Successful test partitions cannot imply a successful or present aggregate. Prove membership with Vitest execution sequencing rather than filesOnly listing, which does not itself shard."
